{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026g1IY00pAWn1793615988.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，元朗YOHO系列屋苑租盤一向特別搶手，租金表現堅挺。Grand YOHO新近錄得 8座高層D室租賃成交，實用面積532平方呎，兩房梗廚間隔，新近以2.26萬元租出，實用呎租42.5元。</p><p></p><p>王勤學表示，業主於2025年12月以734萬元買入單位，租金回報約3.7厘。Grand YOHO本月累錄12宗租賃成交，平均呎租約41元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:02:00.861905+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:58:48.896288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:58:48.896288+00:00","content_hash":"d40697c833f7ede57aa76939aa349de1a65a06056e6e1a4080bdeb938751558d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}